<title>CANADA: Quebecor Inc Q4 net shr profit falls.</title>
<headline>Quebecor Inc Q4 net shr profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			    1995</p>
<p> Shr			 C$0.59		   C$1.39</p>
<p> Net			 38,800		   91,600</p>
<p> Revs		   1,673,300		1,546,600</p>
<p>		  YEAR</p>
<p> Shr			 C$2.23		   C$2.83</p>
<p> Net			146,800		   86,700</p>
<p> Revs		   6,253,300		5,549,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>Note: Net for 1996 fourth quarter includes C$0.06 per share in non-recurring items. Fourth quarter of 1995 includes a loss of C$0.65 a share on non-recurring items and a dilution gain of C$1.34 per share resulting from the issuances of capital stock by subsidiaries.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
</text>
